.intended_display.single_image.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.variant.v8","statement":"variant 또는 대체 시안을 만들지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.weak_outline.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/3","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.weak_outline.v8","statement":"96x144 표시에서 약하거나 사라지는 외부 실루엣 outline을 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.closed_detail_budget.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/3","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.closed_detail_budget.v8","statement":"visible dark line marks는 총 64 이하, internal line marks는 56 이하이며 total을 넘지 않고, 각 garment region의 secondary fold marks는 5 이하이어야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.color_budget.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/7","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_projection.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.color_budget.v8","statement":"모든 accent color는 캐릭터 면적 24% 이하와 최대 4 masses 안에 있어야 하며 각 named garment anchor 영역의 최소 60%를 unfilled base/negative space로 남겨야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.compressed_detail.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/4","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v8","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.compressed_detail.v8","statement":"face, 상투, garment silhouette, armor silhouette, weapon identity를 surface detail보다 먼저 읽히게 하고 각 garment region의 secondary fold marks는 5개 이하로 유지해야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.costume_weapon.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/10","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v8","seojin.appearance.weapon.v8","seojin.appearance.handedness.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.costume_weapon.v8","statement":"조선시대의 빛바랜 군졸복, 여행 겉옷, 수선된 반신 갑옷과 오른손잡이용 장식 없는 조선식 환도를 압축된 식별 실루엣으로 유지해야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.facial_marks.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/2","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_projection.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.facial_marks.v8","statement":"얼굴은 counting unit 기준 총 9 marks 이하이며 brows+eyes 4, nose 1, mouth 1, jaw+face shape 3의 component maxima 안에서 identity-defining marks만 보여야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.identity.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/9","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v8","seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.identity.v8","statement":"젊은 성인 한국 남성의 단순 얼굴, 낮은 조선식 상투, 한쪽 어깨의 수선 반신 갑옷 mass와 왼쪽 허리의 환도 손잡이가 identity anchors로 선명해야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.ink_halo.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/13","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_projection.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.ink_halo.v8","statement":"캐릭터 뒤에는 dark_neutral_ink 색상의 단일 중심 ink halo를 maximum opacity 0.30, canvas coverage 36%로 적용하고, 실루엣 중심에서 가장자리 alpha 0까지 단조롭게 부드럽게 사라지며 scene, opaque background 또는 shadow를 형성하지 않아야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.ink_treatment.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/11","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.materials.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_key.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.ink_treatment.v8","statement":"제한된 flat mass, dry-brush 또는 watercolor accent는 restrained East Asian ink animation-drawing feel을 유지하며 bold silhouette와 identity lines에 종속되어야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.neutral_colors.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/8","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v8","seojin.appearance.weapon.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_projection.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.neutral_colors.v8","statement":"outside outline과 낮은 상투는 dark neutral ink #2B2926, 칼집에 든 환도는 charcoal-brown neutral #34312D로 유지되어야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.outline_hierarchy.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/1","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.materials.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_projection.v8","seojin.single_image.specification.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.outline_hierarchy.v8","statement":"1024x1536 source에서 dark neutral outside silhouette outline은 정확히 18px, sparse internal line은 정확히 8px이어야 하며 2.25:1 계층과 96x144 target의 정확한 1.6875px 외곽 대응을 유지해야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.pose_frame.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/12","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v8","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.pose_frame.v8","statement":"자연스러운 front three-quarter의 중립이지만 즉시 움직일 수 있는 전신 자세를 한 viewpoint로만 사용하고 머리부터 발끝까지 crop 없이 보여야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.primary_color_signature.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/5","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_projection.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.primary_color_signature.v8","statement":"primary faded navy/indigo는 collar crossing과 waist/belt를 잇는 하나의 끊긴 제한 mass 및 sheathed hwando grip의 별도 제한 anchor에만 보여야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.proportion.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/0","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_projection.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.proportion.v8","statement":"전신은 정확히 4.5 heads로 읽히고 4.0–5.0 범위 안에서 짧고 압축된 팔다리를 유지해야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.secondary_color_signature.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/6","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v8","seojin.single_image.expression_profile_projection.v8"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.secondary_color_signature.v8","statement":"secondary dusty gray-brown/ochre는 small utility pouch와 별도의 small travel accessory에만 각각 제한되어야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.specification.v8":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/singleImageSpecification","value":{"anchor":{"groundContactAxis":"horizontal normalized line from (0.25,0.92) to (0.75,0.92)","pelvisOrRootPoint":"normalized canvas point (0.5,0.55)","type":"pelvis_root_ground_axis"},"canvas":{"height":1536,"width":1024},"finalBackgroundPolicy":"transparent","framing":"centered full-body head-to-toe with generous clear space; no crop","generationBackground":{"color":"#F2EFE6","mode":"removable_solid"},"noShadow":true,"outline":{"color":"dark_neutral_ink_#2B2926","enabled":true,"exactThicknessPx":18,"placement":"outside_silhouette"},"pose":"neutral but ready-to-move full-body stance; right hand lightly at the sheathed hwando grip on the left hip","safeArea":"left 96 px, right 96 px, top 96 px, bottom 128 px; the complete subject must remain inside all four insets","targetDisplaySize":{"height":144,"width":96},"viewpoint":"natural front three-quarter view, one approved viewpoint only"}}},"schemaVersion":"character_visual_design_dec